{
  "id": "kings_wend_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A posting house on a straight road, four horses in the yard and a woman writing in a book on the counter."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Horses are hired by the stage. If it is the Kingshold road you want the earlier one.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_night",
          "text": "Do many carts go south off this road at night?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_quarry_night"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_crown",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_wend_night_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_wend_night_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_gibbet",
          "text": "There is a gibbet down the road with nobody's name on it.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_quarry_gibbet"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                14,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_crown",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_wend_gibbet_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_wend_gibbet_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_worked",
          "text": "You post horses over Pennyford. Is that sluice worked?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_ford_worked"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_crown",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_wend_worked_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_wend_worked_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_book",
          "text": "Let me take the book.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "items": [
                "posting_book"
              ],
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "given:posting_book"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                14,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_crown",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_wend_book_gave",
            "onFailure": "kings_wend_book_kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_night_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“They did.” She checks over her shoulder, which answers a different question. “Eleven years of them and not one licensed. I wrote every one down because a posting house writes things down, and nobody ever came and asked me for the book, which I have thought about a great deal.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "kings_quarry_night"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_night_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_night_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_crown",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_night_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_gibbet_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Went up the same year the carts started.” She says it flatly. “Nobody hanged on it — I have had the assize clerk look, he owed me a favour. It is a gibbet that has never been used, on a road with no highwaymen, put up the year something else started.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "kings_quarry_gibbet"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_gibbet_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_gibbet_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_crown",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_gibbet_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_worked_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Up in the spring, down at the harvest, and I set my remounts by it.” She says it without looking up, and then does look up. “Which I have just heard myself say out loud for the first time. The parish has not paid anybody to do that since before I was born.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "kings_ford_worked"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_worked_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_worked_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_crown",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_worked_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_book_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She gets it from under the counter, which is not where a posting house keeps its book. “Eleven years,” she says. “If it turns out somebody at Kingshold has known this the whole time, I would rather hear it from you than from them.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "posting_book",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:posting_book",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_book_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_wend_book_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Not the book,” she says. “I will tell you what is in it. The book stays where it is.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_crown",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_wend_book_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
